Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.31,0:00:49.42,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,Earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:50.49,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.96,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,The mine's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:54.72,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:04.73,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,It's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.31,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,Run! It's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:12.43,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,Run! It's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:13.31,Main,Miner,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:58.67,Main,Anna's Father,0,0,0,,Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:02:01.44,Main,Anna's Father,0,0,0,,You're a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.00,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Die, you filthy witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:29.85,Main,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.41,0:02:32.66,Main,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,She's just a young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:33.82,Main,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Who would've thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.31,Main,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Burn her to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:41.51,Main,Crowd BG Chatter,0,0,0,,Damn the witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:47.42,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,His Highness is truly busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:50.62,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,He doesn't even have time \Nto render a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:53.24,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Carter, do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:56.27,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,His Highness will get out of bed this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:04.17,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,Well, our Border Town is remote \Nand sparsely populated,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:06.06,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,and with a witch causing trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:08.39,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,His Highness probably \Ndoesn't want to stay long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.54,Main,Boris,0,0,0,,We should hurry back to Graycastle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:24.23,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Tyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:25.67,Main,Tyre,0,0,0,,Lord Barov.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:27.56,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Where is His Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:30.66,Main,Tyre,0,0,0,,His Highness... is still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:33.94,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.09,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:37.44,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:42.52,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:01.05,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:02.99,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:06.10,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, wake up! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.21,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.43,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:15.63,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Where am I—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.29,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,It's time for the witch's execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.26,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Everyone is waiting for your verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:23.77,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,Verdict?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:25.86,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,What verdict?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:28.16,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.27,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:32.57,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,This... This feels so real!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.31,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:40.18,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:42.31,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:45.99,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.52,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:54.59,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Barov.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.37,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Your name is Barov.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:04:59.68,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:03.75,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me, your servant Barov.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:06.67,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it's time for the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:07.94,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Let's go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.60,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,Let's observe the situation for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.39,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:33.13,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, let's go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:35.77,Italics,Roland,0,0,0,,What on earth have I been through?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.94,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,His Highness the Prince is coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:18.38,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.02,Main,Guard,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:22.31,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Hang her! Hang her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.83,0:06:27.87,Italics,Roland,0,0,0,,W-Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:43.10,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please give your verdict quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:46.23,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Is she... the witch you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:47.80,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:50.31,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,Witch hunts...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:53.34,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,No... this is too absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:58.95,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I'm tired. Postpone the verdict. \NEveryone is dismissed for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:06:59.54,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.42,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness, this is not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.97,0:07:04.90,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Once a witch is identified, \Nshe should be executed immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.99,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it will attract other witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:10.18,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Carter... Lannis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:11.27,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.56,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,My... Chief Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:17.26,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:20.87,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You're not afraid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:23.70,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Isn't it better for a few more witches \Nto come so we can catch them all at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.73,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:36.82,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Your Highness, why not hang the witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:09.95,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,An unreliable prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:12.52,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,An insignificant territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:15.24,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,An uncivilized society.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.44,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,A dark and ignorant era.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.80,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,A sudden battle for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:28.96,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,What can I possibly do... \Nin this chaotic world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.73,0:10:57.26,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,Since I'm here, I'll make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.28,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,From this day on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:08.70,Italics,Roland OS,0,0,0,,I am Roland Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:15.59,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Good morning, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:19.04,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you summoned me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.57,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Barov, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.42,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:36.48,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, why didn't you \Norder the execution yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:39.07,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,This matter is of grave importance. \NIt cannot be delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.76,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Oh? Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:45.95,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Guards reported sightings of \Nsuspected witches in the western forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:48.11,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,They found this there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.09,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,The Insignia of the\NSacred Mountain and Magic Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:54.01,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,It's the emblem of the \NWitch Cooperation Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.01,0:11:56.60,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,The Witch Cooperation Association? \NWhat's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.85,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,An organization of witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.85,0:12:02.06,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Before it was formed, witches acted alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:03.50,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,But the Association is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.99,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,It wants to unite all witches
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.39,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,to search for the so-called Holy Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:11.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You said... the Holy Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:16.00,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that they can only find eternal \Npeace by going to the Holy Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:20.70,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,For this purpose, the Association even \Nactively lures others into becoming witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:23.81,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Didn't a group of baby girls go missing \Nfrom the Port of Clearwater last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:25.94,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that they were behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:30.36,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You're afraid the Association will hear \Nshe didn't die, and come to rescue her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:32.45,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Precisely, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:34.52,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Those lunatics would even steal babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:37.19,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,They probably wouldn't \Nabandon a fallen comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:40.43,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you must \Nexecute that witch quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:43.06,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,It'd be a problem if she \Nattracted her companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:47.04,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Once someone becomes a witch, \Nshe gains terrifying power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:50.25,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Even knights would struggle to match her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:51.74,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You mentioned power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.10,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What kind of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:55.65,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,And how did you catch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:58.52,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,A few days ago, \Nthe North Slope Mine collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.61,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,She used witchcraft and exposed her identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:02.94,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What kind of witchcraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:06.26,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,She unleashed hellfire
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:07.94,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,and burnt a man to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:10.31,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,The victim melted like wax,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:14.44,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,with his head and most of his \Nbody all over the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:17.63,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want to see something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:21.62,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,So, Your Highness, let's deal with \Nthat witch as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.30,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Take me to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.44,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.73,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,You want to see the witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:28.55,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:31.68,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:33.84,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:36.07,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.12,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,But why death by hanging?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:46.63,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Isn't burning at the stake the \Nusual way of executing witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:47.44,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:51.44,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,But she's not afraid of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:55.06,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness, this is far too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.16,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,We're dealing with an evil witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:14:00.69,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Even though she's bound by God's Locket of \NRetribution, we can't guarantee it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.04,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,If you can't face evil, \Nthen how can you defeat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:07.08,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I thought my Chief Knight \Nunderstood this principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.68,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,You must act within your capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.11,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Recklessness is not bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:13.32,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,So you're saying we should uphold \Njustice against weaker foes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:15.68,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,but ignore stronger ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:18.76,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,No, Your Highness. That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:28.53,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Relax, Carter. Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:30.06,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,But, Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.86,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:35.10,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I am the Lord of Border Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:37.96,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,the Fourth Prince of the Kingdom \Nof Graycastle, Roland Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:39.98,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:42.98,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,My name is Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:46.31,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Miss Anna, what happened \Nin the mine that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:48.48,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I'd like you to tell me in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.86,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,My father is a miner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:59.84,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,When the mine collapsed, \Nhe was working inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:03.01,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,I ran into the mine to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:04.98,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Because of the collapse,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.76,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,my father's leg was trapped \Nunder the fallen rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.48,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Another miner who escaped with him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:13.97,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,tried to steal the few coins he had on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:17.94,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Those were my father's life savings,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.60,0:16:21.48,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,our entire livelihood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:25.85,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,So my father fought back \Nwith all his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:28.85,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,When I found them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:33.55,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,I saw the miner with his pickaxe raised, \Nabout to kill my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:39.31,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,So I... killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.28,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Then how were you captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:48.80,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Someone... reported me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:51.19,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Reported? Who reported you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:59.23,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,It was her father, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:16:59.23,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.90,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,You said it was her father who reported her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.77,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Probably for the bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:10.12,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Those who discover and report witches
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.75,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,receive a reward of 25 gold royals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:14.72,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,For someone with a broken leg,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:17.91,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,that's enough to secure the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.34,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,He was a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:25.51,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,How did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:29.81,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,It was what you call...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:32.08,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,the power of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.73,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Really? The power of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.05,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Can you show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:37.74,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:41.49,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, she's currently being \Nsuppressed by God's Stone of Retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.14,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,If she's released, the consequences \Nwill be unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.79,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Is this your first time \Nmeeting a witch, Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:50.75,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Your curiosity might kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:54.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,If you truly are an evil devil, \Nthen it shouldn't be me who dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.17,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,It should be your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.49,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness. Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:12.02,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.23,0:18:13.94,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:16.08,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:22.09,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:24.99,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Are you really a pitiful girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.73,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,or are you a devil with \Nsuperb acting skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:29.66,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.14,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:57.54,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:58.73,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,No, Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:00.17,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,Wait, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:01.98,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,What's there to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.48,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,The flames...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.21,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,The flames aren't coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:10.92,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,She's consciously controlling the flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:11.98,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,She's not going to hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:18.73,Main,Carter,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:19.85,Main,Barov,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.81,0:19:59.81,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Lord, has your curiosity been satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:03.31,Main,Anna,0,0,0,,Can you kill me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:24.39,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,No, Miss Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.17,Main,Roland,0,0,0,,I want to hire you.
